# One case per expectation, in file order; `name` is the spec's context and test name,
# `option` the segmenter options the spec passes, `skipped-upstream` a test the spec skips.

case pragmatic-segmenter/dutch_spec/001
lang nl
name Golden Rules: Sentence starting with a number #001
text Hij schoot op de JP8-brandstof toen de Surface-to-Air (sam)-missiles op hem af kwamen. 81 procent van de schoten was raak.
sentence Hij schoot op de JP8-brandstof toen de Surface-to-Air (sam)-missiles op hem af kwamen.
sentence 81 procent van de schoten was raak.
end

case pragmatic-segmenter/dutch_spec/002
lang nl
name Golden Rules: Sentence starting with an ellipsis #002
text 81 procent van de schoten was raak. ...en toen barste de hel los.
sentence 81 procent van de schoten was raak.
sentence ...en toen barste de hel los.
end

case pragmatic-segmenter/dutch_spec/003
lang nl
name #segment: correctly segments text #001
text Afkorting aanw. vnw.
sentence Afkorting aanw. vnw.
end
